      "answer_en": "Share the location, space type, approximate area, photos, issues and proposed work. A free quotation follows the confirmed scope; site-review arrangements depend on access and schedule. Measurement is free within 30 km of the company or service point. Travel beyond 30 km is chargeable; confirm the amount before the appointment.",
